#!/bin/sh
# Green-gate the commit: the capability catalog must be fresh and the tooling
# tests must pass. A stale catalog or a broken generator blocks the commit —
# this is what makes "100% embedded docs" a mechanical guarantee, not a promise.
set -e

echo "pre-commit: checking capability catalog freshness…"
node tools/catalog/catalog.ts --check

echo "pre-commit: running tooling tests…"
node --test "tools/**/*.test.ts" >/dev/null

echo "pre-commit: ok"
